#! ia 1.0

@schema playbook
  lowers to definition
  sections
    must have meaning
    must have cognition
    may have relationships
    may have activation
    may have subject
    closed
  fields
    must have meaning.says as text
    must have meaning.answers as text
    may have subject.subject-word as id
    may have subject.subject-kind as id in [governance, contract, definition, template, check, policy, binding]
